<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.66 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.66 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.66 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.6532 on Thursday.</p>
<p>					   Jan 14		 Jan 9</p>
<p> lei per dollar			4.6600		 4.6532</p>
<p> volume traded ($)		   400,000		300,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
